      "content": "i don't know about the water or the window. it feels pointless. everything is just... a burden now. even getting up to go to the bathroom is a chore. i used to be so independent, and now i'm just waiting for someone to come and help me with things i should be able to do myself. it's undignified. it feels like i'm just lingering.",
